        <mxCell id="DLHhegnfPAVYRj_QVORQ-15" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Procedural and Metacognitive Knowledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;CP: &lt;i&gt;Apply, Analyze, Evaluate and Create&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;SLOs: (a) select and justify appropriate research methods; (b) design and implement structured methodologies; (c) evaluate the feasibility and ethical considerations; (d) apply and create relevant techniques or algorithms; (e) collect and analysis data and results; (f) interpret results and evaluate limitations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="147" width="275" x="510" y="-997" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DLHhegnfPAVYRj_QVORQ-16" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Metacognitive Knowledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;CP: &lt;i&gt;Apply, Evaluate and Create&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;SLOs: (a) develop, synthesize, revise and edit information into compelling narrative to an academic audience; (b) deliver a clear and engaging oral presentation; (c) reflect on learning process and research journey, identify strengths, challenges and areas for growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="270" x="70" y="-760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DLHhegnfPAVYRj_QVORQ-17" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=default;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;strokeColor=none;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;CP: Cognitive Process&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;SLO: Student Learning Objective&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;The cognitive process and student learning objectives in this proposal are designed based on the revised version of Bloom&#39;s Taxonomy.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
